The marks in this folder are from Simple Icons (https://simpleicons.org), version 16.35.0, released under CC0 1.0
Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/): asana, atlassian, box, brave, cloudflare, figma,
github, google, huggingface, imessage, instagram, intercom, linear, modelcontextprotocol, neon, notion, sentry, stripe,
supabase, todoist, vercel, wix and x. Each file keeps the icon's path alone.

